# Karn, Gilded Guardian costs five twobrid symbols; the five Moxen each pay one on turn 3. Its enters trigger
# draws a card for each color among *other* artifacts its controller controls (CR 105.2): the five Moxen are
# colorless, and Deconstruction Hammer, white, is the only colored one, so Karn draws one card - and Karn itself,
# an artifact, is not counted.

